{"speciesId":650,"names":{"fr":"Marisson","es":"Chespin","en":"Chespin","ja":"ハリマロン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Lorsqu’il rassemble ses forces, les piquants souples qui recouvrent sa tête deviennent si durs et acérés qu’ils pourraient transpercer un rocher."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando acumula energía, las suaves púas de su cabeza se vuelven tan duras y afiladas que hasta pueden atravesar rocas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The quills on its head are usually soft. When it flexes them, the points become so hard and sharp that they can pierce rock."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"普段 やわらかい 頭の トゲは 力を こめると 鋭く とがり 岩をも つらぬくほど 硬くなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa tête et son dos sont recouverts d’une carapace tellement dure que même une collision avec un camion ne lui ferait rien."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La robusta coraza que le recubre la cabeza y la espalda lo protege de tal manera que podría chocar contra un camión y permanecer impasible."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Such a thick shell of wood covers its head and back that even a direct hit from a truck wouldn’t faze it."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"頭と 背中を 硬い 樹木の 殻で 覆われているため トラックが ぶつかってきても 平気なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lorsqu’il rassemble ses forces, les piquants souples qui recouvrent sa tête deviennent si durs et acérés qu’ils pourraient transpercer un rocher."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando acumula energía, las suaves púas de su cabeza se vuelven tan duras y afiladas que hasta pueden atravesar rocas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The quills on its head are usually soft. When it flexes them, the points become so hard and sharp that they can pierce rock."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"普段 やわらかい 頭の トゲは 力を こめると 鋭く とがり 岩をも つらぬくほど 硬くなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sa tête et son dos sont r